      "category": "transport",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Arden Middle School, built in 1914, and the Del Paso Country Club, opened in 1919, are among the area's oldest surviving structures.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
